{
  "version": 1,
  "timing_source": "edge_word_boundaries_pcm_samples",
  "sample_rate": 48000,
  "total_duration": 109.676,
  "sections": [
    {
      "section": "cold_open",
      "label": "Eleven listened",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 16.948,
      "duration": 16.948,
      "beats": [
        {
          "beat_id": "cold_open_beat_01",
          "section_id": "cold_open",
          "text": "At 11:47 at night, I watched eleven tiny \u201clistened\u201d icons appear under a voice note that was not supposed to leave my phone.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "speech_end_time": 7.574937,
          "end_time": 7.574937
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "cold_open_beat_02",
          "section_id": "cold_open",
          "text": "The note was one minute and fifty-two seconds long, and it had gone to the office group chat. My manager was in that group. So were both interns.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 7.574937,
          "speech_end_time": 16.728,
          "end_time": 16.948
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "setup",
      "label": "The setup",
      "start": 16.948,
      "end": 39.08,
      "duration": 22.132,
      "beats": [
        {
          "beat_id": "setup_beat_01",
          "section_id": "setup",
          "text": "That morning, someone had announced a Saturday team-building day.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 16.948,
          "speech_end_time": 20.170354,
          "end_time": 20.170354
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "setup_beat_02",
          "section_id": "setup",
          "text": "I was fine with the Saturday part. I was less fine with the phrase \u201chigh-energy icebreaker.\u201d",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 20.170354,
          "speech_end_time": 25.648354,
          "end_time": 25.648354
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "setup_beat_03",
          "section_id": "setup",
          "text": "So that night I recorded a voice note for my friend Sam.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 25.648354,
          "speech_end_time": 29.515167,
          "end_time": 29.515167
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "setup_beat_04",
          "section_id": "setup",
          "text": "I said I would rather file my taxes in a moving car than explain my spirit animal to Accounting.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 29.515167,
          "speech_end_time": 35.637646,
          "end_time": 35.637646
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "setup_beat_05",
          "section_id": "setup",
          "text": "The note was dramatic and private for about three seconds.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 35.637646,
          "speech_end_time": 38.86,
          "end_time": 39.08
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "wrong_chat",
      "label": "Wrong chat",
      "start": 39.08,
      "end": 58.548,
      "duration": 19.468,
      "beats": [
        {
          "beat_id": "wrong_chat_beat_01",
          "section_id": "wrong_chat",
          "text": "Sam's chat sat directly under a group called \u201cSaturday Offsite.\u201d",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 39.08,
          "speech_end_time": 42.781542,
          "end_time": 42.781542
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "wrong_chat_beat_02",
          "section_id": "wrong_chat",
          "text": "I tapped, held the button, delivered my tiny speech, and hit send without reading the name at the top.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 42.781542,
          "speech_end_time": 49.814458,
          "end_time": 49.814458
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "wrong_chat_beat_03",
          "section_id": "wrong_chat",
          "text": "Then Sam texted me separately.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 49.814458,
          "speech_end_time": 51.665229,
          "end_time": 51.665229
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "wrong_chat_beat_04",
          "section_id": "wrong_chat",
          "text": "\u201cWrong chat.\u201d",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 51.665229,
          "speech_end_time": 52.405542,
          "end_time": 52.405542
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "wrong_chat_beat_05",
          "section_id": "wrong_chat",
          "text": "I looked back at the screen and felt every useful thought leave my body at once.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 52.405542,
          "speech_end_time": 58.328,
          "end_time": 58.548
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "damage_control",
      "label": "Damage control",
      "start": 58.548,
      "end": 78.736,
      "duration": 20.188,
      "beats": [
        {
          "beat_id": "damage_control_beat_01",
          "section_id": "damage_control",
          "text": "I found \u201cdelete for everyone,\u201d but eleven people had already listened.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 58.548,
          "speech_end_time": 62.270854,
          "end_time": 62.270854
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "damage_control_beat_02",
          "section_id": "damage_control",
          "text": "So I typed an apology.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 62.270854,
          "speech_end_time": 63.963042,
          "end_time": 63.963042
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "damage_control_beat_03",
          "section_id": "damage_control",
          "text": "It started with \u201cFor context,\u201d which is how you know an apology is about to create more context.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 63.963042,
          "speech_end_time": 70.054979,
          "end_time": 70.054979
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "damage_control_beat_04",
          "section_id": "damage_control",
          "text": "I deleted that too.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 70.054979,
          "speech_end_time": 71.40875,
          "end_time": 71.40875
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "damage_control_beat_05",
          "section_id": "damage_control",
          "text": "Then my manager reacted to the original voice note with a thumbs-up and wrote, \u201cLooking forward to your energy tomorrow.\u201d",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 71.40875,
          "speech_end_time": 78.516,
          "end_time": 78.736
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "next_morning",
      "label": "The next morning",
      "start": 78.736,
      "end": 103.556,
      "duration": 24.82,
      "beats": [
        {
          "beat_id": "next_morning_beat_01",
          "section_id": "next_morning",
          "text": "The next morning, everyone was painfully kind to me.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 78.736,
          "speech_end_time": 81.944688,
          "end_time": 81.944688
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "next_morning_beat_02",
          "section_id": "next_morning",
          "text": "Nobody mentioned the voice note. This was worse.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 81.944688,
          "speech_end_time": 84.796875,
          "end_time": 84.796875
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "next_morning_beat_03",
          "section_id": "next_morning",
          "text": "The organizer had replaced the icebreaker with \u201cshare one fun fact.\u201d",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 84.796875,
          "speech_end_time": 88.718604,
          "end_time": 88.718604
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "next_morning_beat_04",
          "section_id": "next_morning",
          "text": "When it reached me, my manager smiled and said, \u201cYou seem to have strong feelings about group activities. Why don't you start?\u201d",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 88.718604,
          "speech_end_time": 96.562083,
          "end_time": 96.562083
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "next_morning_beat_05",
          "section_id": "next_morning",
          "text": "My fun fact was that I had recently learned how long one minute and fifty-two seconds can feel.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 96.562083,
          "speech_end_time": 103.336,
          "end_time": 103.556
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section": "button",
      "label": "Mostly solved",
      "start": 103.556,
      "end": 109.676,
      "duration": 6.12,
      "beats": [
        {
          "beat_id": "button_beat_01",
          "section_id": "button",
          "text": "I renamed the office chat \u201cDO NOT SEND AUDIO HERE.\u201d",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 103.556,
          "speech_end_time": 107.636,
          "end_time": 107.636
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "button_beat_02",
          "section_id": "button",
          "text": "That solved the problem.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 107.636,
          "speech_end_time": 109.268,
          "end_time": 109.268
        },
        {
          "beat_id": "button_beat_03",
          "section_id": "button",
          "text": "Mostly.",
          "kind": "narration",
          "start_time": 109.268,
          "speech_end_time": 109.676,
          "end_time": 109.676
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
